  AUTHORS   Ventura,A., do Nascimento,A.A., dos Santos,M.A., Vieira-Lopes,D.A.,
            Sales,A. and Pinheiro,N.L.
  TITLE     Analysis of the expression of p53 during the morphogenesis of the
            gastroesophageal mucosa of Gallus gallus domesticus (Linnaeus,
            1758)
  JOURNAL   Cell Tissue Res 355 (1), 111-119 (2014)
   PUBMED   24068480
  REMARK    GeneRIF: Protein p53 occurs at key stages of development: in the
